- §2–5 rule impl, registration, CLI override (custom `flag.Value` validating in `Set()`, apply *after* rules are constructed, override only its own dimension), fixture classification.
- §6 the e2e matrix the step-4 retry was judged down for — precedence proven **in both directions**, three states, dual call sites, skip cases.
