aws --ignore=tests/test_contrib/test_hypothesis/test_type_resolution.py\n```\n\n**Bottom line**: the `cond.py` requirement is confirmed implemented and now has concrete captured evidence. The hypothesis-strategy and suite evidence is the only gap, and it is a tool-access gap, not an implementation gap.' additional_kwargs={'refusal': None} response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 1061, 'prompt_tokens': 38421, 'total_tokens': 39482, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': None, 'cached_tokens': 38272}, 'prompt_cache_hit_tokens': 38272, 'prompt_cache_miss_tokens': 149}, 'model_provider': 'deepseek', 'model_name': 'deepseek-flash', 'system_fingerprint': 'bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6', 'id': 'f48262e9-7d76-4c35-9b5b-cc5d884c4909', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None} id='lc_run--01a213f7-e7c4-77c2-86c5-41ac9a1102c4-0' tool_calls=[] invalid_tool_calls=[] usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 38421, 'output_tokens': 1061, 'total_tokens': 39482, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 38272}, 'output_token_details': {}}
