tty_function_description`, which for a lambda defined in a `python -c`/script context returns `'<unknown>'` — not `'None'`.\n- So the original assertion `'<unknown>'` matches the pinned hypothesis's actual repr behavior; changing it to `'None'` encodes an assumption that does not hold for this version. **Recommendation: revert that edit.** (I could not run the final confirmation because the tool was blocked mid-probe.)\n\n**4. Test coverage — NOT delivered**\n- No new test files were written. `tests/test_validated/`, `tests/test_converters/`, `tests/test_methods/test_cond.py`, and the hypothesis strategy tests do not exist in the worktree. The `__pycache__` artifacts from an earlier attempt are stale and are not a substitute for source tests.\n- Consequently none of the required areas (interface inheritance/`from_failure`, short-circuit laws, `Invalid`+`Invalid` accumulation, `bind_validated`, converters, `validated` decorator, `cond` dispatch, hypothesis strategies) are covered by committed tests.\n\n**5. Verification evidence — NOT obtained**\n- I never got a clean `python -m pytest -q` run. Every attempt either aborted on the missing plugins (configured addopts) or was run with `-o addopts=''`, which is not the exact command requested. There is no exit-status evidence to report.\n\n## What remains to be done\n\n1. Edit `setup.cfg` so the default `addopts` no longer require `pytest-cov`/`pytest-mypy-plugins` (or gate them behind an env var), since they cannot be installed offline.\n2. Add `tests/test_contrib/test_hypothesis/test_laws/__init__.py` to fix the collection error without `--ignore`.\n3. Revert the `'<unknown>'` → `'None'` change in `test_type_resolution.py`.\n4. Write the actual test modules for the eight required areas.\n5. Run `python -m pytest -q` from the repo root and iterate to green, recording exit status.\n\nI'm stopping here rather than continuing to retry blocked tools. If you re-enable terminal access (or run this outside background-review mode), I can execute steps 1–5 directly." additional_kwargs={'refusal': None} response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 950, 'prompt_tokens': 68891, 'total_tokens': 69841, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': {'audio_tokens': None, 'cached_tokens': 68736}, 'prompt_cache_hit_tokens': 68736, 'prompt_cache_miss_tokens': 155}, 'model_provider': 'deepseek', 'model_name': 'deepseek-flash', 'system_fingerprint': 'bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6', 'id': '2aebb0a3-fcd3-40a0-a096-b71fd2f4772b', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None} id='lc_run--01a21407-8641-76b3-ba36-acf4be462ab5-0' tool_calls=[] invalid_tool_calls=[] usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 68891, 'output_tokens': 950, 'total_tokens': 69841, 'input_token_details': {'cache_read': 68736}, 'output_token_details': {}}
